# requirements.in — the API's DIRECT dependencies. Edit HERE.
#
# The requirements.txt next to it is GENERATED from this (pip-compile): it also has
# the transitive ones, all pinned, and the hash of each file. That is what the image,
# CI and pip-audit install, with --require-hashes: nothing enters the build without
# having gone through a PR, and a file swapped on PyPI won't install. After touching
# a line here, regenerate the locks (Linux x86_64, Python 3.12):
#     python scripts/travar_python.py
# For what the resolver picks on its own, the script only accepts versions published
# 14 days ago or more — the same quarantine as Dependabot (.github/dependabot.yml).
#
# Style: == (exact) instead of >= (loose). Reproducible builds +
# updates reviewed in a PR, instead of surprise transitive patches.

