# HTML sanitization (email body coming from the SendEmail node, via the executor).
# nh3 is the binding for ammonia (Rust): a real allowlist, with an HTML parser.
# Replaced a blacklist regex filter that could be bypassed by
# reconstruction — "javjavascript:ascript:" became "javascript:" again after
# the single removal pass. See tests/unit/test_email_html_sanitizer.py.
